<?php /** @var \Core\Security\Csrf $csrf @var array $services @var array $plans @var ?string $error @var bool $sent @var array $old @var string $chosen @var string $basePath @var string $responseTime @var string $estimateNotice */ ?>
<section class="l-page-hero"><p class="l-eyebrow">Free estimate request</p><h1>Tell us about your property.</h1><p>Accurate details and clear photos help the team prepare before following up.</p></section><section class="l-section l-form-wrap"><?php if ($sent): ?><div class="l-success" role="status"><h2>Request received.</h2><p><?= e($responseTime) ?></p><a class="l-btn l-btn-primary" href="<?= e_attr($basePath) ?>/">Return home</a></div><?php else: ?><?php if ($error): ?><div class="l-error" role="alert"><?= e($error) ?></div><?php endif; ?><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="l-estimate-form"><?= $csrf->field() ?><div class="l-form-grid"><label>Full name<input name="name" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="name" value="<?= e_attr($old['name']??'') ?>"></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" value="<?= e_attr($old['email']??'') ?>"></label><label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="tel" value="<?= e_attr($old['phone']??'') ?>"></label><label>Property type<select name="property_type"><?php foreach(['Residential','Commercial','HOA / Multi-property','Other'] as $option): ?><option<?= ($old['property_type']??'Residential')===$option?' selected':'' ?>><?= e($option) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label class="l-span-2">Property address<input name="address" required maxlength="255" autocomplete="street-address" value="<?= e_attr($old['address']??'') ?>"></label><label>City<input name="city" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="address-level2" value="<?= e_attr($old['city']??'') ?>"></label><label>State<input name="state" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="address-level1" value="<?= e_attr($old['state']??'') ?>"></label><label>ZIP code<input name="zip" required maxlength="20" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" value="<?= e_attr($old['zip']??'') ?>"></label><label>Approximate lot size<input name="lot_size" maxlength="80" value="<?= e_attr($old['lot_size']??'') ?>" placeholder="Unknown is okay"></label><label class="l-span-2">Services of interest<select name="service_interest" required><option value="">Choose a service or plan</option><optgroup label="Services"><?php foreach ($services as $service): ?><option value="<?= e_attr($service['name']) ?>"<?= $chosen===$service['name']||$chosen===$service['slug']?' selected':'' ?>><?= e($service['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></optgroup><optgroup label="Maintenance plans"><?php foreach ($plans as $plan): $value='Maintenance plan: '.$plan['name']; ?><option value="<?= e_attr($value) ?>"<?= $chosen===$value||$chosen===$plan['slug']?' selected':'' ?>><?= e($plan['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></optgroup><option<?= $chosen==='Multiple services / not sure'?' selected':'' ?>>Multiple services / not sure</option></select></label><label>Preferred schedule<input name="schedule_preference" maxlength="120" value="<?= e_attr($old['schedule_preference']??'') ?>" placeholder="As soon as available"></label><label>Budget range<select name="budget"><?php foreach([''=>'Prefer to discuss','Under $500'=>'Under $500','$500–$1,500'=>'$500–$1,500','$1,500–$5,000'=>'$1,500–$5,000','$5,000–$15,000'=>'$5,000–$15,000','$15,000+'=>'$15,000+'] as $value=>$label): ?><option value="<?= e_attr($value) ?>"<?= ($old['budget']??'')===$value?' selected':'' ?>><?= e($label) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label class="l-span-2">Project details<textarea name="message" rows="6" maxlength="5000"><?= e($old['message']??'') ?></textarea></label><label class="l-span-2">Property photos <small>Up to three JPG, PNG, or WebP images, 15 MB each</small><input type="file" name="photos[]" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple></label></div><label class="l-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="1" required<?= !empty($old['consent'])?' checked':'' ?>> I authorize the company to contact me about this request.</label><p class="l-form-note"><?= e($estimateNotice) ?></p><label class="l-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label><button class="l-btn l-btn-primary">Send estimate request</button></form><?php endif; ?></section>
